{"id": "t049-013", "text": "Gustavo is into vintage cameras, mostly old Pentax ones. He mentioned the K1000 a couple of times, which feels like a hint for his birthday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vintage cameras, mostly old Pentax ones", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mentioned the K1000", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t049-017", "text": "Ioana is throwing a surprise 40th for her husband on the 3rd. I'm in charge of the playlist, and she wants everyone there by 6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise 40th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 6", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t049-020", "text": "Wei's graduation ceremony is on the 9th at 10am, then lunch with the family afterwards. Must remember to send flowers that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation ceremony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-023", "text": "Lachlan has a big presentation at work on Tuesday morning and is dreading it. Remind me to text him good luck on Monday evening, then ask how it went on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big presentation at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t049-024", "text": "Gareth said his dad retires at the end of the month. They're doing a meal at the golf club on the 30th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meal at the golf club", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t049-025", "text": "Abigail's son Chidi is in the school play on Thursday at 6pm. He's playing the wolf and has been practising his howl all week, much to the annoyance of their neighbours. Abigail can't get the afternoon off, so her husband Ryan is taking him. Remind me to ask Abigail on Friday how it went, and whether anyone filmed it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 6pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbours", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the afternoon"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Abigail", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-026", "text": "Farah mentioned she's struggling a lot with her dissertation. The deadline is the 18th and she feels behind.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "deadline", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "behind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t049-029", "text": "Ravi said his sister Irina just got into medical school. Remind me to send her a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into medical school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t049-038", "text": "Ioana's book club dinner is postponed indefinitely because her landlord is doing work on the kitchen. Barbara is hosting a smaller get-together at hers instead, on Thursday at 7. We're reading the new Sally Rooney, and I haven't started it yet. Barbara is gluten free, so whatever I bake needs to be too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "smaller get-together", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t049-041", "text": "Need to ring Lachlan on Sunday about the dinner plans for his mum's 70th.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Lachlan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t049-044", "text": "Gareth and Abigail's anniversary dinner on Saturday has been cancelled. Their babysitter fell through, so they're doing a takeaway at home instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "babysitter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "takeaway at home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t049-045", "text": "Chidi is sitting his eleven-plus on the 15th. His mum says he's surprisingly calm about it. I should drop off a good luck card the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eleven-plus", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off a good luck card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-046", "text": "Farah's housewarming is next Saturday at 3pm. She's just moved into a two-bed in Chorlton with her girlfriend, Hana Morris.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday at 3pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two-bed in Chorlton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana Morris", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t049-050", "text": "Irina said her boss is leaving and she might be up for his role. She has an interview on the 4th at 10am. She seemed fairly relaxed about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th at 10am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fairly relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t049-051", "text": "Aneesh's grandad passed away on Tuesday. The funeral is next Friday at 1pm. Aneesh is flying back to Delhi on Wednesday to be with the family. Remind me to check in with him over the weekend and, if he's back by then, take him for a coffee the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back to Delhi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by then", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t049-052", "text": "Mrs Tanaka next door is having a little party for her 80th on Sunday afternoon in the church hall. Her son Kalani is coming up from London for it with his kids, and she asked me to help set up that morning from about 10. Must remember to buy her some lilies on Saturday, since she said roses make her sneeze.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Tanaka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "80th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming up from London", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning from about 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy her some lilies", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "roses make her sneeze", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t049-053", "text": "Note for later: Olivia hates surprises, so no surprise party for her birthday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprises", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t049-054", "text": "Spoke to Dr Petrov about Matteo. He's recovering well after the operation and should be home by Thursday, though he'll need physio twice a week for a while. His partner Jakub is working from home to look after him. I'll visit him on Friday afternoon, and maybe take him some of those almond biscuits he likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Petrov", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "physio twice a week", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "working from home", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday afternoon"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "almond biscuits", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t049-055", "text": "Big dinner at Francesca and Gustavo's on the 19th at 7:30 to celebrate their daughter finishing her PhD. Dress code is smart casual, and Francesca said she'd sort a taxi back for anyone who needs one. I'm sharing a ride with Naledi and Kwame there and then making my own way home later.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Big dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th at 7:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "later"}]}
{"id": "t049-059", "text": "Lachlan has started learning Portuguese because his partner's family are from Porto. He's going over to meet them for the first time at Christmas, flying out on the 22nd and staying for a week. He's nervous about the language barrier and about her dad, who apparently doesn't say much. He's doing an evening class on Wednesdays and an app on the side.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Porto", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over to meet them", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't say much", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "evening class", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}]}
{"id": "t049-060", "text": "Svetlana's daughter Layla is starting her first proper job on Monday at an architecture firm in Leeds. Svetlana is clearly so proud. Remind me to send Layla a quick message that evening to ask how her first day went, and then check in again the week after when she's settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first proper job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "architecture firm in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Layla a quick message", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in again", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's settled", "anchor": "a2"}]}
